    "title": "Triumph Foods announces $30 million expansion in St. Joseph - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Noel Hardin ,\n15 hours ago ST. JOSEPH, Mo. (KQTV) -- On April 1st, 2026, Triumph Foods, LLC, announced a nearly $30 million expansion to its facility at Stockyards Expressway. The expansion is set to increase the company's current cold storage and shipping space, by acquiring and installing new equipment, machinery, and personal property related to the project, setting the stage for increased production. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 2",
